@startuml
title ERD (Logical) - Purchasing, Supplier Finance and Budget Workflow

hide methods
hide stereotypes
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

entity "User / Department" as User
entity "Purchasing Lookup" as Lookup
entity "Purchase Request\n(status in JSON payload)" as PR
entity "Purchase Order\n(status in JSON payload)" as PO
entity "Supplier Acknowledgement" as Ack
entity "Supplier Delivery" as Delivery
entity "Goods Received Note" as GRN
entity "Supplier Invoice" as Invoice
entity "Supplier Payment" as Payment
entity "Monthly Budget" as Budget
entity "Budget Prediction" as Prediction
entity "Budget Adjustment Request" as Adjustment
entity "Upcoming Budget Event" as Event
entity "Notification" as Notification

User ..> PR : requester / approver
User ..> PO : executive / manager
User ..> Ack : supplier
User ..> Delivery : supplier
User ..> GRN : requester verifies
User ..> Invoice : supplier / finance
User ..> Payment : payment team
User ..> Adjustment : department submits / finance reviews
User ..> Event : executive or manager records
User ..> Prediction : authorized forecast viewer

Lookup ..> PR : category, unit, terms
PR ..> Budget : reserve and release amount
PR ..> PO : APPROVED request creates draft
PO ..> Ack : APPROVED PO requires acknowledgement
Ack ..> Delivery : ACKNOWLEDGED creates pending delivery
Delivery ..> GRN : submitted delivery creates GRN task
GRN ..> Invoice : COMPLETED enables invoice
Invoice ..> Payment : APPROVED creates PENDING_PAYMENT
GRN ..> Delivery : DISCREPANCY creates resend cycle

PR ..> Notification : submit, change, approve, reject
PO ..> Notification : manager approval result
Ack ..> Notification : supplier response
Delivery ..> Notification : delivery submitted
GRN ..> Notification : received or discrepancy
Invoice ..> Notification : finance review result
Payment ..> Notification : paid confirmation
Adjustment ..> Notification : budget review result
Prediction ..> Adjustment : forecast supports proposal
Event ..> Prediction : upcoming impact context

note "The workflow tables are physical snapshot stores. Links above are business references in JSON/localId, not SQL foreign keys." as N
N .. PR
N .. PO
N .. Ack
N .. Delivery
N .. GRN
N .. Invoice
N .. Payment
@enduml
